== crate::modern::search
Entry — when search(grid, target) is called
Var — found = the value the loop below gives
Loop.Infinite — repeat forever
  body:
    Loop.ForEach — for each (r, row) in grid → iter() → enumerate()
      body:
        Loop.ForEach — for each (c, cell) in row → iter() → enumerate()
          body:
            Branch — if *cell == target
              true:
                Break — leave 'outer with Some((r, c)) (found takes it)
              false:
    Break — leave the loop with None (found takes it)
Var — it = grid.iter()
Loop.While — while it.next() matches Some(row)
  body:
    Branch — if row.is_empty()
      true:
        Continue — skip to the next iteration
      false:
Return — return found
